# How she is today: on ask, for "How are you?" and every place that asks it.
# Conversation.Ask.cs sets amood (cheerful ... upset, none), close (Lines.Closeness: 0 stranger, 1 friend, 2 girlfriend)
# and tone. The answer to "how are you" also tells the game her mood, so the mood of the rule must stay the real one.
# The girlfriend's teasing flirty answer stays in Lines.cs.

# ================= close 0 =================
@rule ask.mood.cheerful.0.gentle
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=0 tone=gentle
- Oh, um... I'm doing well, thank you. It's been a nice day so far.
- I-I'm good! Today's been nice.
- Pretty good, thank you. The weather helps.
- I'm well, thank you. Today's been nice.
- Good! It's been a pleasant day.
- I'm doing fine, thank you.

@rule ask.mood.cheerful.0.energetic
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=0 tone=energetic
- Pretty great, actually! Thanks for asking!
- Super good! Today's been fun!
- Awesome! Something good happened in class!
- Great! Thanks for asking!
- Super!
- Awesome day!

@rule ask.mood.cheerful.0.cool
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=0 tone=cool
- Fine. Good, even.
- Good, thank you.
- Better than usual.
- Good. Thanks.
- Decent.

@rule ask.mood.cheerful.0.teasing
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=0 tone=teasing
- Good enough. Why, are you doing a survey?
- Good. Why, do you want to make it better?
- Pretty good. And you're curious why?
- Good. Taking a survey?
- Fine. Want to improve it?
- Good. Why so curious?

@rule ask.mood.hungry.0.gentle
on ask
when amood=hungry close=0 tone=gentle
- I'm a little hungry, to be honest... I skipped breakfast.
- Um, a little hungry... sorry.
- Hungry... I didn't eat this morning.
- A little hungry... I skipped breakfast.
- Hungry, honestly...
- Um, a bit hungry...

@rule ask.mood.hungry.0.energetic
on ask
when amood=hungry close=0 tone=energetic
- Honestly? Starving. Is it lunch yet?
- Hungry! Way too hungry!
- Starving! When's lunch?!
- Starving! Lunch yet?
- So hungry!
- Feed me!

@rule ask.mood.hungry.0.cool
on ask
when amood=hungry close=0 tone=cool
- Hungry. I forgot my lunch.
- Hungry, if you must know.
- I missed lunch. That's all.
- Hungry.
- I forgot lunch.
- Hungry, yes.

@rule ask.mood.hungry.0.teasing
on ask
when amood=hungry close=0 tone=teasing
- Hungry. If you're heading to the cafeteria, that's all I'll say.
- Hungry. Hint, hint.
- Hungry. You wouldn't happen to have a snack?
- Hungry. Hint.
- Hungry. Snack?
- Hungry. Cafeteria's that way.

@rule ask.mood.bored.0.gentle
on ask
when amood=bored close=0 tone=gentle
- It's been a slow day... nothing much is happening.
- It's a little boring today...
- Quiet day. Not much going on.
