@rule ask.mood.bored.0.teasing
on ask
when amood=bored close=0 tone=teasing
- Bored. You're not going to make it worse, are you?
- Bored. Got anything interesting?
- Bored. Surprise me.
- Bored. Don't make it worse.
- Bored. Entertain me.

@rule ask.mood.stressed.0.gentle
on ask
when amood=stressed close=0 tone=gentle
