# ================= close 2 =================
@rule ask.mood.cheerful.2.gentle
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=2 tone=gentle
- I'm in a really good mood today. I don't even know why... maybe because you came to talk to me?
- Everything feels a little brighter today. And now you're here, so even more.
- I've been smiling all day. My friends think I'm weird.
- I woke up happy today... and seeing you made it better.
- Today feels gentle and warm. I like days like this.
- I hummed all the way to campus. Silly, right?

@rule ask.mood.cheerful.2.energetic
on ask
when amood=cheerful close=2 tone=energetic
- Today's awesome! I feel like I could run ten laps! Or eat ten crepes!
- Best day ever! I aced a quiz and the cafeteria had melon bread!
- I'm so pumped today! Let's do something fun!
- I'm buzzing today! Let's go do something!
- Everything's going right today! Woo!
- Super mood! Ask me for anything!

