on ask
when amood=cheerful close=2 tone=cool
- ...I'm fine. Better than fine, actually. Don't make it weird.
- Good. Unusually good. I'm suspicious of it.
- I'm in a good mood. Don't ruin it. ...You won't.
- ...Good mood. Enjoy it quietly.
- Today is pleasant. Unusually.
- I'm content. Don't comment on it.

