on ask
when amood=cheerful close=2 tone=teasing
- Hm? You can tell I'm in a good mood? Then take advantage of it while it lasts~
- Great mood today. Maybe I'll even be nice to you~
- I'm in such a good mood I might spoil you. Might.
- Good mood. You might get lucky today~
- I'm feeling generous today. Ask nicely.
- Happy mood. Better make the most of it~

