# ================= what you ask =================
@rule me.ask.stranger
on me.ask
when close=0
- Hi. How's your day going?
- Hey, how are you today?
- Hello. Having a good day?
- [Hello. Having a good day?|Hi. Busy day?]
- [Excuse me, hi. How's it going?|Hey. Everything okay?]

@rule me.ask.close
on me.ask
when close!=0
- How are you today?
- How's your day going?
- You okay? How are you feeling today?
- [Hey. How are you really?|So how's today treating you?]
- [You look good today. Are you?|How are you holding up?]
